flowchart TB
  subgraph operatorInfra [Operator Infrastructure]
    gateway[Operator DPM Gateway]
    subgraph dpmw [DPM Wallet Docker Container]
      api[Express API plus Auth]
      services[Address and Signing Services]
      adapter[VaultWalletAdapter]
      sdk[vendored dpm-sdk build functions]
      vault[KeyVault Port]
      sqlite[(SQLite Volume)]
    end
  end
  turnkey[Turnkey TEE]
  relayer[relayer-api GET /relay-payload]
  plaee[Plaee Backend]

  gateway -->|API key| api
  api --> services
  services --> sdk
  services --> sqlite
  sdk --> adapter
  adapter --> vault
  vault -->|TurnkeyKeyVault only| turnkey
  sdk -->|"X-API-Key via injected fetchImpl, read-only"| relayer
  api -->|signed payloads returned| gateway
  gateway -->|submits| plaee
